    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d516">

                <pb facs="0534" n="500" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg500"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Sherman to Mr.
                            Woodford.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-11-03"><hi rendition="#italic">November 3,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Strenuously urge decision Salomon tobacco case. Important papers left Havana 30th
                    ultimo. Endeavor to expedite action colonial minister, who understands case.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sherman.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
